DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
21721::$$$message_0169_0000_0000$$$::I need to check his intention first after all.[lr]::
21722::$$$message_0169_0000_0001$$$::He is the type that falls clearly into "combative" among the Servants.[lr]::
21723::$$$message_0169_0000_0002$$$::It's possible that he would gladly adapt to the current situation, always happy to fight anything.::
21724::$$$message_0169_0001_0000$$$::"Huh? So it's Saber's Master.[lr]::
21725::$$$message_0169_0001_0001$$$::Guess I'm letting my guard down too much. Didn't realize who it was for a bit there."[lr]::
21726::$$$message_0169_0001_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Letting my guard down, my ass.[font italic=false][lr]::
21727::$$$message_0169_0001_0003$$$::Despite stealthily approaching him, he noticed me from nearly ten meters away like it was nothing.::
21728::$$$message_0169_0002_0000$$$::"Don't try to copy Assassin, you're no good at it. And even if you try to steal some, I haven't gotten a single fish yet."::
21729::$$$message_0169_0003_0000$$$::"...It seems like I'm out of luck today. Go elsewhere if you're trying to prepare for dinner."[lr]::
21730::$$$message_0169_0003_0001$$$::Mrgh. That's rare for Lancer, who can survive anywhere, whether it's land, sea, or mountains, to be out of luck.[lr]::
21731::$$$message_0169_0003_0002$$$::No, that's not the problem.::
21732::$$$message_0169_0004_0000$$$::"What do you mean preparing for dinner?"[lr]::
21733::$$$message_0169_0004_0001$$$::"That's because I'm doing it for you, ultimately. In the evening, an energetic girl comes over asking for fresh ones and takes a bucket full of fish."::
21734::$$$message_0169_0005_0000$$$::"Oof. M-my apologies for that.[lr]::
21735::$$$message_0169_0005_0001$$$::...Who knew that the cause of Fuji-nee bringing more fish home was here? The world is too small."::
21736::$$$message_0169_0006_0000$$$::"Chalk it up as a wonder of the world. Well, the girl herself is a mound of mystery to begin with.[lr]::
21737::$$$message_0169_0006_0001$$$::So. If you're not after food, what did you come here for, boy?"::
21738::$$$message_0169_0007_0000$$$::Ultimately, he [font italic=true]is[font italic=false] a Servant, with business never far off.[lr]::
21739::$$$message_0169_0007_0001$$$::I thought he had become complacent with peace, since he had assimilated into city life more than Saber and the others, but of course that's not really the case.::
21740::$$$message_0169_0008_0000$$$::"I came here about more serious stuff. I'll get straight to the point.[lr]::
21741::$$$message_0169_0008_0001$$$::Lancer. What do you think about the current situation?"[lr]::
21742::$$$message_0169_0008_0002$$$::[font italic=true]No, first of all.[font italic=false][lr]::
21743::$$$message_0169_0008_0003$$$::"Why are you still here again?"::
21744::$$$message_0169_0009_0000$$$::Lancer is Kotomine's Servant.[lr]::
21745::$$$message_0169_0009_0001$$$::But Kirei Kotomine passed away half a year ago.[lr]::
21746::$$$message_0169_0009_0002$$$::Servants cannot exist if they lose their Master. Therefore, it's odd that Lancer is here in the first place.::
21747::$$$message_0169_0010_0000$$$::"Well, I made a contract with a Master, right?[lr]::
21748::$$$message_0169_0010_0001$$$::Putting that Gilgamesh guy aside, I don't have the power to stay in this world without a Master."[lr]::
21749::$$$message_0169_0010_0002$$$::"Huh? Contract? But Kotomine[line len=2]"[lr]::
21750::$$$message_0169_0010_0003$$$::"Died. He certainly did die. But, the contract is still active for some reason.[lr]::
21751::$$$message_0169_0010_0004$$$::I also am curious about that[line len=2]"::
21752::$$$message_0169_0011_0000$$$::"Well, I'm still here, so it's fine. There's no use in worrying about being alive.[lr]::
21753::$$$message_0169_0011_0001$$$::You should go with the flow. Don't sweat the small stuff. You should think about 'how' and not 'why' if you're that concerned."::
21754::$$$message_0169_0012_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
21755::$$$message_0169_0012_0001$$$::...Ugh, what he said opens my eyes.[lr]::
21756::$$$message_0169_0012_0002$$$::His whole [font italic=true]I'm well aware that the current situation isn't normal, but what about it? I'm just me, so I'll do what I want[font italic=false] mentality.[lr]::
21757::$$$message_0169_0012_0003$$$::Literally, he's telling me to let it be. His dauntlessness makes all my worrying seem inconsequential. ::
21758::$$$message_0169_0013_0000$$$::"Okay. So what, you don't even try to figure out your situation even though you have an active contract but no Kotomine?"::
21759::$$$message_0169_0014_0000$$$::"Hm? Yeah, I don't feel like I have to go out of my way to look into it.[lr]::
21760::$$$message_0169_0014_0001$$$::As long as no one puts up a fuss, I'm gonna do what I want."::
21761::$$$message_0169_0015_0000$$$::"Does that apply to the Holy Grail War too? You also sense that the battle has resumed, right?"::
21762::$$$message_0169_0016_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, that. There certainly is a rising urge to defeat the other Servants, but that's it.[lr]::
21763::$$$message_0169_0016_0001$$$::Look man, I'm neutral in all this.[lr]::
21764::$$$message_0169_0016_0002$$$::I don't really care about it, but I'll match any challengers."::
21765::$$$message_0169_0017_0000$$$::Lancer isn't lying.[lr]::
21766::$$$message_0169_0017_0001$$$::I'd have thought Lancer would be more spoiling for a fight, but even he seems apathetic about the situation.[lr]::
21767::$$$message_0169_0017_0002$$$::[font italic=true]...That's right.[font italic=false][lr]::
21768::$$$message_0169_0017_0003$$$::I'm the one who thought Lancer has assimilated more than Saber. I guess that means he's enjoying his life here.::
21769::$$$message_0169_0018_0000$$$::"I see. Saber and Rider are friends for you now.[lr]::
21770::$$$message_0169_0018_0001$$$::You wouldn't try to kill each other."::
21771::$$$message_0169_0019_0000$$$::"The hell you on? Servants are all enemies."[lr]::
21772::$$$message_0169_0019_0001$$$::He quickly answers.[lr]::
21773::$$$message_0169_0019_0002$$$::The same ruthlessness as when he nearly killed me half a year ago.::
21774::$$$message_0169_0020_0000$$$::"...Oh. You get along with anybody. Yet, you're saying that everyone is an enemy?"::
21775::$$$message_0169_0021_0000$$$::"Stupid, that's something different.[lr]::
21776::$$$message_0169_0021_0001$$$::I can like someone even if they're an enemy. There's no reason I have to hate them just because they're opposing me."::
21777::$$$message_0169_0022_0000$$$::   My jaw drops.[lr]::
21778::$$$message_0169_0022_0001$$$::I was already amazed by how bold he was, but this blows me away on a whole other level.::
21779::$$$message_0169_0023_0000$$$::"...I'm beat. You're amazing."[lr]::
21780::$$$message_0169_0023_0001$$$::"Some kid's praise isn't gonna do it for me.[lr]::
21781::$$$message_0169_0023_0002$$$::Are we done talking? I'll go back to fishing then. I have a feeling a good one'll come soon."[lr]::
21782::$$$message_0169_0023_0003$$$::Lancer returns to fishing, as if nothing happened.::
21783::$$$message_0169_0024_0000$$$::I leave the port, satisfied with the answer that I got.[lr]::
21784::$$$message_0169_0024_0001$$$::"...Oh, but does that mean..."[lr]::
21785::$$$message_0169_0024_0002$$$::Lancer said that there's no need to hate enemies.[lr]::
21786::$$$message_0169_0024_0003$$$::Those feelings and the battlefield are separate.[lr]::
21787::$$$message_0169_0024_0004$$$::But, on the other hand...[lr]::
21788::$$$message_0169_0024_0005$$$::That means if Lancer were facing an opponent that was family or a loved one, he would still kill them without prejudice.::
921728::$$$message_9169_0002_0000$$$::"Don't try to copy Assassin, you're no good at it. And even if you try to steal some, I haven't gotten a single fish yet."[r]::

